<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $46-1/2 (FIM 212.19).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $46-1/2 (FIM 212.19).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-3/4 at $46-1/2 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 212.19 markka. In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed up 6.00 markka at 216.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed $0-3/8 lower at $32-3/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.87 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.40 markka at 74.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed down $0-1/4 at $20-1/4 in New York on Friday. The price corresponds to 92.40 markka. Rauma closed down 1.40 at 92.60 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
